{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04248","headline":"晚渡黄河 · 骆宾王","name":"晚渡黄河","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千里寻归路，一苇乱平源。\n通波连马颊，迸水急龙门。\n照日荣光净，惊风瑞浪翻。\n棹唱临风断，樵讴入听喧。\n岸迥秋霞落，潭深夕雾繁。\n谁堪逝川上，日暮不归魂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04248.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04248","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}